@startuml 09-contract-states
' UML state machine: the life of a contract (ADR-0007). Every transition is a server function.
!include style.iuml
hide empty description
skinparam nodesep 30
skinparam ranksep 40

[*] --> Draft : Départ started

state Draft
Draft : details saved as they are typed
Draft : the vehicle status doesn't change
Draft --> [*] : discarded\n/ draft deleted, audited

Draft --> Active : client signs the Départ\n/ number MCR-YYYY-NNNN\n/ revision 1 frozen\n/ vehicle → rented

state Active {
  state "On rental" as OnRental
  state "Retour in progress" as ReturnInProgress
  [*] --> OnRental
  OnRental --> OnRental : amendment\n/ new revision, own signature\nor « sans signature du client »
  OnRental --> ReturnInProgress : Retour started
  ReturnInProgress : saved as it is typed
  ReturnInProgress : client absent → « en attente de signature »
}

ReturnInProgress --> Closed : client signs the Retour\n(mandatory, F-04)\n/ vehicle → available
OnRental --> Void : voided before any Retour,\nwith a reason\n/ vehicle → available

state Closed
Closed : never edited
Closed : kept until the retention rules apply (L-07)
state Void
Void : never edited
Void : PDFs watermarked « ANNULÉ / VOID »
Closed --> [*]
Void --> [*]
@enduml
